{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございます！\n一つ一つの言葉がじわじわと胸にしみました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもパワーもらいました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにこの一年間、沢山のことがあったけれど、\n一分一秒も無駄な時間はなかったと思います！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一秒一秒がとても大切な時間で、\n涙が出るのは、それだけ期待もしたし、頑張ったから！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一周年記念日にお台場合衆国でライブをさせていたはだきました！\nその時に並んでくださってたのを見て！感動してしまい、ついパシャリと盗撮してしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の頃に比べ、沢山のファンのかたがいて、\n支えてくれて......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って改めて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして、色々なことに気づかせていただけたのも、大好きなメンバー！\nそして、スタッフ、\n何よりもファンの皆様です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポテトを頬張るヤマポテトおねぇーちゃんです！もう中身が少なくなっている！わぁーおっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、\n『妹！妹！』\nっていってくるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな可愛くて、面白くて、優しいおねぇーちゃんがだいすきなんだー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹で良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっと、もう一人私を狙うおねぇちゃんがいたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投げキスとかめっちゃ飛ばしてく！\nまるでせいたんみたいだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁそれを私は華麗によけてみせるのだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヘヘッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、斜め前にはニヤニヤしながらblogコメントを読むネネコロを盗撮！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい笑顔だ！\nニヤニヤと言うより、\nもうすでに笑ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー内ではよくみる光景だッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、そっとしてあげて、メンバー誰しもがそうだから.........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても、ねねころの携帯がやけに大きく見える"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃんちっちゃいからなぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そう言えば昨日50?髪切ったんだー！\n写メ張りすぎて、サイズオーバーだから今回は残念っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ひめたんとミサミサとまあやでイオンのキャンペーン中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しぃー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヘアーはミサミサがやってくれたんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいじゃろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、ホテルは一人ずつの部屋だから、\nひめたんとまあやで同じ部屋に泊まってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにいくのも、ずっとくっついてるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかホテルめっちゃこわかったんでーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今さっきふたりでちょー狭いお風呂一緒に入った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のホテルのお風呂は狭すぎてキツキツやったぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまは一緒にテレビ見てのんびりしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも宿題もせんといけんのんじゃぁーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！まぁじゃぁ明日は鳥取でイベントあるからここらへんにしとこーっとっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら遊びにきてねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近暑さ対策で皆がオデコにヒエピタ張りすぎて、体調不良なのか暑いのかわからず、\n心配しずらい和田でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑さ対策してるー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/24/3956038/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}